Data 2006-01-03 .. 2026-11-06 (5245 sessions), SPY + QQQ. Split train/test at 2016-01-01.
Base rules: FTD >=1.25% on higher volume on day 4-30 of a rally attempt (either index); distribution day = down >=0.2% on higher volume, expires after 25 sessions or +5%; UNDER PRESSURE at 5+ (max of the two indices), CORRECTION at 7+ or 8% below the 252-day high; back to UP when count <= 3 and both indices over the 50-day.
Exposure: CORRECTION 10%, UNDER PRESSURE 50%, UPTREND 40% -> 60% -> 80% -> 100% over the first 10 sessions after the follow-through.

